<!-- The AFCCA brief's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the typst
     template (Times New Roman, Rule 17.1(a)) at 12 pt (size 24 half points); Body Text in 24.6 pt line boxes (typst
     pitch-body, double-spaced) with a half-inch first-line indent; block quotations, footnotes and the heading styles
     in 14.7 pt boxes (typst pitch-single); 12 pt above and below a quotation, 6 pt after a footnote (typst quote block
     and footnote.entry gap). afcca.lua writes every other paragraph with its own spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
